PLE2510 [*] Invalid unescaped character backspace, use "\b" instead
  --> invalid_characters.py:15:6
   |
13 | #        (Pylint, "C3002") => Rule::UnnecessaryDirectLambdaCall,
14 | #foo = 'hi'
15 | b = '␈'
   |      ^
16 | b = f'␈'
   |
help: Replace with escape sequence
   |
15 - b = '␈'
15 + b = '\b'
   |

